{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:b4e9ac9363ebd465","name":"Marooned","source":{"id":"source:reference-b4e9ac9363ebd465","title":"Marooned","revision":20700,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:21:23Z","sha256":"39f139d09643a40f00b060a194af57be1bd16dc79ef6488594e4f81603237df4","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20700","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Marooned&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-b4e9ac9363ebd465","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You were abandoned in a remote locale and forced to fend for yourself with little hope of rescue or survival. Perhaps you were a ",{"tag":"a","children":["TIE Fighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/TIE_Fighter","referenceId":"reference:726e84ae35ac767c"}," pilot whose ship crashed on an uninhabited world, left to rot when your commanding officer refused to send a search-and-rescue team after you. Alternatively, you might have been the lone survivor of a pirate attack on an Outer Rim settlement that damaged your equipment and prevented you from summoning help. Whatever the event, it left you isolated for an extended time; after you escaped or were rescued, you resolved to make your mark on the galaxy.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Relevant Skills:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ride"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ride","referenceId":"reference:439efdc566bb419f"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Survival"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Survival","referenceId":"reference:8302496de0ace160"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swim","referenceId":"reference:dd4fa375c70c4e42"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Enhancement:"]}," As a result of having been marooned, you have learned to survive without the aid of civilization. You take no penalty to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"}," checks made to administer ",{"tag":"a","children":["First Aid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/First_Aid"}," to yourself (or to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," checks made to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Repair"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Repair"}," yourself, if you are a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"},").\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
